Neat NM-1000 per-mode init data
===============================

These files are *measured* USB traffic captured from the vendor's
Windows driver while scanning on the author's own hardware — not
firmware extracted from the device, and no vendor binaries. They are
published under the same license as the SANE project itself.

- nm1000-ctrl-{gray,color}{150,300,600}.json
  Ordered EP0 vendor control scripts (OUT payloads + IN lengths).
  Tables 9-11 carry the mode/DPI programming; tables 0-8 are
  mode-generic init. The backend replays them verbatim.

- nm1000-{150,300,600}{gray,color}-out.bin (+ -long- variant)
  Host-to-scanner bulk-OUT shading/calibration blocks, split in
  captured transfer lengths by the MODE_CFG table in neatnm1000.c.
  Replayed verbatim; expect mild shading error if lamp/paper differ.

Total ~200 KB. Without them the backend reports SANE_STATUS_IO_ERROR
at scan start (see the missing-data diagnostic in sane_start).
